1
00:00:03,600 --> 00:00:04,651
Open any Markdown file

2
00:00:04,701 --> 00:00:07,818
Click Open Preview to Side

3
00:00:07,868 --> 00:00:10,861
The styled page appears next to your source

4
00:00:10,911 --> 00:00:14,439
Front matter becomes a table, prose becomes a page

5
00:00:14,489 --> 00:00:16,553
Edit where you read: switch on Edit mode

6
00:00:16,603 --> 00:00:19,476
Click a paragraph and type

7
00:00:19,526 --> 00:00:22,121
Done: the page, the source and the file stay in step

8
00:00:22,171 --> 00:00:25,771
Bold with Cmd+B

9
00:00:27,627 --> 00:00:30,888
Save, and the file on disk is up to date

10
00:00:30,938 --> 00:00:34,262
Type / for the command menu

11
00:00:34,312 --> 00:00:37,912
Pick a block: a callout, a table, a figure

12
00:00:44,797 --> 00:00:48,397
MyST cards and tabs render live: switch a tab with a click

13
00:00:51,879 --> 00:00:55,062
Vega-Lite charts render in place

14
00:00:55,112 --> 00:00:58,712
and so do Mermaid diagrams

15
00:01:01,271 --> 00:01:04,871
Review: select a phrase and comment

16
00:01:06,868 --> 00:01:09,883
The thread opens on the phrase, stored beside the document

17
00:01:09,933 --> 00:01:13,533
Navigate with the outline and the toolbar

18
00:01:14,854 --> 00:01:18,454
Switch the theme: Cream to Dark

